{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story takes place after the outbreak of the zombie apocalypse. You and a group of survivors must build a base in a world overrun by the undead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong><br>\u2727 4 story-rich chapters with over 15 hours of gameplay<br>\u2727 Supports both pixel and HD visual styles. You can disable either one. The pixel style offers a simplified look during dialogues, ideal for players who just want tower defense action.<br>\u2727 Over 11 unique [Survivors]. Choose one [Survivor] per run\u2014each with skills that shape your deployment strategy.<br>\u2727 Raise [Survivor] affinity by deploying them in missions to unlock their personal stories.<br>\u2727 A wide range of buildings and units, each upgradeable in different directions. Combine with character skills to unlock unexpected effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Gather resources and build your defense line before the zombies arrive<br>\u2727 Protect your base in a world crawling with zombies<br>\u2727 Construct and upgrade resource buildings during missions to build powerful towers and defenses<br>\u2727 Prepare carefully\u2014before each wave hits, you'll need to secure enough resources to survive<br>\u2727 Unlock new types of buildings as you progress, and mix them to strengthen your defense<br>\u2727 Zombies usually come alone at first\u2026 but soon they'll charge at you in relentless waves</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701980?t=1760924119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701980/96ade2d66f9db917c43a3457e4ce77639b2a30f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760924119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701980/b90e9cbd0988c3fb0dbbd2d861a38f18a28d5c3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760924119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam